;
; How Dyer files one swatch of a palette in MYRA (dyer_rules.h DY6): its
; place in the palette (0 .. 63) and its colour as one number 0xRRGGBB
; (0 .. 16777215). The record holds the place in 2 digits and the colour
; in 8; swatch.eve holds each to its range.
^ZXDYER(place:i2) = color:i8!
